# packagefinder

This application is used to search for software packages. It is fully compatible with all versions of Slackel, Slackware and Salix distributions.

✨ Main Features:

    Universal Support: Full functionality for Slackel, Slackware and Salix.

    All Versions: Compatibility with every version of the above distributions.

    Official Repositories: Direct access to the central repos of the ecosystem.

    Third-Party Repos: Integration of external third-party repositories for the Slackware ecosystem.

    Single Search: Locate official and third-party packages in one environment.

🛠️ Technologies & Architecture:

The application was developed with modern and efficient technologies:

    Python & HTML: The core of the application and the graphical user interface.

    JSON: Use of JSON files for fast and direct package search.

    Mariadb Database: Built-in database for recording statistics.

📊 Statistics & User Login:
Through the SQLite database, the application collects anonymous statistics to improve your experience:

    Number of Online Users: Monitoring of active users in real time.

    Operating System: Recording of the distribution/version used for the connection.

    Statistics Tab: All connection data and user statistics are immediately visualized through the special built-in tab of the application statistics.

    Avg Graphs: The page includes specialized graphs that display the average of users for the last 7 days (avg last 7 days) as well as for the last 30 days (avg last 30 days) for better monitoring of long-term activity.

Examples:
To search for a package

    choose from Repository: All Repositories, Arch: x86_64, In Search type firefox
    You get results for all Repositories, for firefox all versions x86_64 package.

    choose from Repository: 15.0 Arch: x86_64, In Search type firefox
    You get results for all Repositories 15.0 , for firefox x86_64 package.

    Typing firefox-152 or firefox 152 get firefox 152 x86_64 package of slackel
    Typing firefox salix get all firefox packages for all salix versions
    Typing firefox salix 15 or firefox 15 salix get firefox package for salix 15.0 version
    Typing firefox slackware 15 get firefox package for slackware 15.0
    Typing firefox slackware current get firefox package for slackware current
    Typing firefox slackware get firefox package for all slackware versions

    choose from Repository: salix 15.0 in search type geany you get geany and geany-plugins and geany-themes for salix 15.0
    Typing geany 2.1 you get eany and geany-plugins

